      "section": "news",
      "kind": "news",
      "title": "Biotech’s boardroom gains for women fail to translate to CEO roles",
      "summary": "출처 피드 발췌 (원문 언어 · 분석 전): Women held 29% of biotech board seats in fiscal 2025 but just 8.8% of CEO roles, highlighting uneven progress across industry leadership spots.",
